rule first_band_above v1
description "A band a policy first table writes, read with the amount it is decided from: small comes only at 115 yen, which none of the first three rows of the table above takes, so no row is asked for small at 102 yen or less"

enum choice = one | two
enum size = small | medium | large

inputs
  amount : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=115JPY

outputs
  x : choice

table band_of
policy first
| amount         | -> band : size |
| >15JPY <=40JPY | medium         |
| >=41JPY <=114JPY | medium       |
| <16JPY         | large          |
| -              | small          |

table pick
| amount    | band       | -> x |
| <=102JPY  | not: small | one  |
| >=103JPY  | small      | two  |
| >=103JPY  | not: small | one  |
